 (multi-turn back-and-forth in the process surface)\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/epic.md:967:- AC-3.2 (outstanding question or request remains visible)\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/epic.md:968:- AC-3.3 (submitted response becomes durable visible history)\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/epic.md:969:- AC-3.4 (surface does not falsely present waiting-for-reply state)\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/epic.md:970:- AC-3.5 (invalid response rejected without misleading visible history)\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/epic.md:971:- AC-3.6 (successful response updates surface in same session)\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/epic.md:990:**Prerequisite:** Story 3\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/stories/04-materials-and-outputs.md:14:- **Key Constraint:** The work surface must support substantial process conversation and active progress without flattening the experience into generic chat or forcing the user to reconstruct context from the shell alone.\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/stories/04-materials-and-outputs.md:37:- Story 3 conversation/current-request slice\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/stories/coverage.md:19:| AC-3.1 | TC-3.1a, TC-3.1b | Story 3 |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/stories/coverage.md:20:| AC-3.2 | TC-3.2a, TC-3.2b | Story 3 |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/stories/coverage.md:21:| AC-3.3 | TC-3.3a, TC-3.3b | Story 3 |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/stories/coverage.md:22:| AC-3.4 | TC-3.4a, TC-3.4b | Story 3 |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/stories/coverage.md:23:| AC-3.5 | TC-3.5a, TC-3.5b | Story 3 |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/stories/coverage.md:24:| AC-3.6 | TC-3.6a, TC-3.6b | Story 3 |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/stories/coverage.md:25: