n degrades |\\\\n473:## Interface Definitions\\\\n475:### Page-Level Dependencies\\\\n492:### Section Interfaces\\\\n527:### Live Update Apply Contract\\\\n548:- `materials` messages by replacing `processSurface.materials`\\\\n551:## Client Testing Strategy\\\\n565:- `tests/service/client/process-materials-section.test.ts`\\\\n\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"}}\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/story-verification/04-materials-and-outputs/codex-impl-round-1-stalled.jsonl:16:{\\\"type\\\":\\\"item.completed\\\",\\\"item\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"item_7\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"command_execution\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"/bin/zsh -lc 'rg -n \\\\\\\"''^#|Story 4|materials|outputs|TC-4|empty state|revision|artifacts|attachments\\\\\\\" docs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/tech-design-server.md'\\\",\\\"aggregated_output\\\":\\\"1:# Technical Design: Process Work Surface Server\\\\n8:## Server Bootstrap\\\\n15:### Entry Point: `apps/platform/server/index.ts`\\\\n26:### App Factory: `apps/platform/server/app.ts`\\\\n39:## Top-Tier Surface Nesting\\\\n54:## Module Architecture\\\\n84:│       │   ├── materials-section.reader.ts # NEW\\\\n89:│           ├── process-materials.builder.ts # NEW\\\\n97:### Module Responsibility Matrix\\\\n112:| `readers/materials-section.reader.ts` | NEW | Read current artifact/source/output context and return a section envelope | Convex queries, materials builder, module registry | AC-4.1 to AC-4.4, AC-6.6 |\\\\n115:### Component Interaction Diagram\\\\n127:    Mat[\\\\\\\"materials-section.reader.ts\\\\\\\"]\\\\n155:## Durable State Model\\\\n161:- current process-owned outputs\\\\n166:### Design Stance\\\\n178:### Convex Tables\\\\n185:| `processOutputs` | NEW | Current process-owned output summaries | Outputs in progress and outputs not yet published as durable artifacts |\\\\n186:| `artifacts` | EXISTS | Durable artifact rows | Read as current materials when process surface references them |\\\\n187:| `sourceAttachments` | EXISTS | Durable source rows | Read as current materials when process surface references them |\\\\n188:| `processProductDefinitionStates` | MODIFIED | ProductDefinition-specific state | Add small bounded fields needed for current materials projection |\\\\n192:### Convex Field Outline\\\\n226:  relatedArtifactId: v.union(v.id('artifacts'), v.null()),\\\\n243:  linkedArtifactId: v.union(v.id('artifacts'), v.null()),\\\\n245:  revisionLabel: v.union(v.string(), v.null()),\\\\n251:### `processes` Table Changes\\\\n264:### Index Plan\\\\n277:### Query Discipline\\\\n292:- outputs: `.take(20)`\\\\n296:## Core Interfaces\\\\n298:### Process Surface Summary\\\\n311:### Process Action Result\\\\n323:### Process Surface Service\\\\n335:### Process Live Hub\\\\n353:## Flow 1: Durable Process Surface Bootstrap\\\\n369:    participant Mat as materials-section.reader.ts\\\\n382:        Mat->>Convex: query processOutputs + referenced artifacts/sources\\\\n407:| TC-1.4a | bootstrap includes current work state | `tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts` | Visible history/materials/sideWork exist | Response contains all sections |\\\\n408:| TC-1.4b | early process still opens cleanly | `tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts` | Empty history/materials/sideWork | Empty envelopes returned |\\\\n415:## Flow 2: Start and Resume Process Actions\\\\n462:## Flow 3: Response Submission and Current Request Projection\\\\n534:## Flow 4: Current Materials and Current Outputs\\\\n538:The materials flow is where the shared surface meets process-owned semantics.\\\\n539:Artifacts and source attachments already exist as generic tables, but the\\\\n542:rows and combines them with current process-owned outputs.\\\\n546:    participant Reader as materials-section.reader.ts\\\\n553:    Reader->>Convex: get referenced artifacts and sources\\\\n555:    Reader-->>Reader: apply no-duplication rule for linked outputs\\\\n562:entry from `currentOutputs